@Pretest_GenAI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5226

### 1. Test Successful Summarize Request (Example from PDF)
POST {{Pretest_GenAI_HostAddress}}/api/summaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "The library opens from 8:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Monday to Friday.\nStudents can borrow up to three books for 14 days.\nLate returns may result in a fine."
}

### 2. Test Invalid Request - Blank Content (Expect HTTP 400)
POST {{Pretest_GenAI_HostAddress}}/api/summaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "   "
}

### 3. Test Invalid Request - Missing Content (Expect HTTP 400)
POST {{Pretest_GenAI_HostAddress}}/api/summaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### 4. Get All Saved Summaries from SQL Server
GET {{Pretest_GenAI_HostAddress}}/api/summaries
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Summary by ID
GET {{Pretest_GenAI_HostAddress}}/api/summaries/1
Accept: application/json
